      "id": "claim_6a501fc9c448472f9dd251a00f7821e0",
      "statement": "The host face's six plugins inject the cordis services they consume: SkillForgeGateway injects ['llm','agentDefaultModel']; ToolIntegrationsGateway injects ['loader'] to hot-mount MCP loader entries; A2AToolsPlugin injects ['tools'] to register model-facing tools; A2AInboundPlugin injects ['webServer','llm','agentDefaultModel'] to register the agent-card and /a2a endpoints; ProfileSkillProviderPlugin injects ['skills'] to register a per-profile skill provider; A2AConfigGateway is pure file-backed and injects no harness service.",
