      "id": "claim_bec5dd32cdbd4c4a9b399c53a12ee9d7",
      "statement": "The client registers components into seven harness-declared SlotMap rows: conversation.view (dashboard order 20, skill-forge 30, tool-integrations 40, a2a-management 50), shell.overlay (pet, task-manager-panel order 100), sidebar.brand.mark and sidebar.brand.name (priority -1, PapergamesLogo/Wordmark), conversation.hero.brand.mark (priority -1, PapergamesLogo), sidebar.footer.action (order 10, BackgroundSwitcher), and conversation.session.header.actions (order 20, TaskManagerTrigger); registration correctness depends on the harness semantics that list rows render by ascending order and single brand/hero rows resolve by lowest priority.",
